{"source_index":1605,"html_quotation_context":false,"text":"NOTE 15. RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS"}
{"source_index":1606,"html_quotation_context":false,"text":"Equity Method Investments"}
{"source_index":1607,"html_quotation_context":false,"text":"We have equity method investments in entities that own or lease properties for which we provide management services and receive fees. In addition, in some cases we provide loans, preferred equity, or guarantees to these entities."}
{"source_index":1608,"html_quotation_context":false,"text":"The following table presents Income Statement data resulting from transactions with these related parties. This table does not include our Financial Statement captions with insignificant related party activity."}
{"source_index":1609,"html_quotation_context":false,"text":"(in millions)202520242023"}
